In-Reply-To: <fqB1vlaRb5g.1mBYl5YJdksJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
References: <fqB1vlaRb5g.1mBYl5YJdksJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/fqB1vlaRb5g/m/3JZntaakBDQJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
